// Your Apple Developer Team ID.
//
// Find it by opening Xcode > Settings > Accounts, selecting your Apple ID,
// then clicking your name under "Team". The ID is the 10-character string
// in parentheses. With a free account it is usually your personal team.
//
// Alternatively, after signing anything once:
//   security find-identity -v -p codesigning
//
// Leave blank to let Xcode pick, but command-line builds will fail to sign.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
